play muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711840/extras/9fba1da7fb2c4f52a4e97865a8d37601.poster.avif?t=1680040927\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711840/extras/9fba1da7fb2c4f52a4e97865a8d37601.webm?t=1680040927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711840/extras/9fba1da7fb2c4f52a4e97865a8d37601.mp4?t=1680040927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>When Yarbor's lead researcher Ivan discovers a change at the planet's core, a power struggle ensues at the company. This conflict forever changes the lives of all mechanics and organics on Corut. <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Reveal Ivan's discovery<br></li><li>Explore the power struggle and its ramifications<br></li><li>Recognize your part in the this conflict<br></li><li>Resolve the conflict and change life on Corut forever</li></ul></h2></h2>",
